DESCRIPTION:(694) Ekard hides a magnitude 8.6 star\, seen from Tirupati.\nY
 ou are inside the path\, 46 km from its centre line: the star vanishes for
  up to 2.6 s.\nClosest approach 19:56:02 IST\, give or take 1 s. The star 
 is 20° up in the WSW · dark sky.\nIt fades 5.4 magnitudes for up to 3.5 
 s on the centre line\, and the path is 122 km wide\, give or take 19 km.\n
 Finder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/aster
 oids-2026-10#2026-10-07-694-ekard-075136
